1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,081
This window only tells its story where the sun falls.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,390
At dawn, a knight was sent to slay the dragon that ate the sun.

3
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,747
He crossed the hills and rivers in the white noon light.

4
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:28,185
All afternoon they fought, and the shadows grew longer.

5
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:38,000
Then, in the red of evening, he saw what the dragon was guarding.

6
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,266
The last ember of the sun, kept warm until morning.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,817
So the knight laid down his sword.

8
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,493
And every night since, one pane of glass keeps its own light.
